hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"741","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aadmi sattar saal tak Ahle Jannat ke a'mal karta rahta hai. Lekin jab woh apni zindagi ke aakhri hisse mein pahunchta hai aur waseeyat karta hai to woh apni waseeyat mein insaf nahin karta. To us ka khatma burai walon ke a'mal par hota hai aur woh jahannam mein dakhil hota hai. Aur aadmi sattar saal tak burai walon ke a'mal karta rahta hai. Lekin jab woh apni zindagi ke aakhri hisse mein pahunchta hai aur waseeyat karta hai to woh apni waseeyat mein insaf karta hai. To Allah us ka khatma Ahle Jannat ke a'mal par farmata hai aur woh jannat mein dakhil hota hai.' Phir Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne yeh ayat tilawat farmai: 'Jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki ita'at kare, Woh use un baghat mein dakhil farmayega jin ke neeche nahrein behti hain... ayat ke aakhir tak, ke us ke liye zillat wala azab hai.'"
"742","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se marfoo'an riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Waris ke haq mein waseeyat jaiz nahin hai.'"
"743","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Us ki walida faut ho gayin; agar woh un ki taraf se sadaqa kare to kya use nafa hoga? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Han.' Us ne kaha: Mere paas khajooron ka bagh hai; main Aap ko gawah banata hun ke main ne use un ki taraf se sadaqa kar diya hai. Ruh kahta hai: «مخرفة» ka ma'na khajooron ka bagh hai."
